{
  "documents": [
    {
      "title": "Agreed order scope",
      "text": "Order form — 4 March\nSeller: Zuri, Kenya\nBuyer: Elin\nGoods: brass home decor\nCurrency: EUR\n\nRequirements agreed:\nSupply two hammered brass candleholders, each 20 cm tall.\nInclude two removable brass drip trays, one for each candleholder.\nInclude one printed care card with cleaning instructions.\nApply a protective clear lacquer to both candleholders.\n\nThe candleholders and trays are to have a warm brass finish. The buyer accepted the quoted total of EUR 86, including packing and delivery. The care card is to be placed inside the parcel rather than sent separately. Zuri will notify Elin when the goods are handed over. Any change to these requirements must be agreed by both parties before dispatch."
    },
    {
      "title": "Delivery and unpacking note",
      "text": "Delivery note — 18 March\nFrom: Zuri\nTo: Elin\n\nThe parcel was handed to Elin today. We opened it together and checked the contents against the order form before I left. Inside were two hammered brass candleholders. We measured each one at 20 cm tall. There were also two removable brass drip trays, one fitted to each candleholder.\n\nNo printed care card was in the parcel or among the packing materials. I checked the empty box and wrapping a second time. Elin kept all four brass pieces and the packing slip. We did not test the surface coating or examine the production records during the handover. Both of us acknowledged the contents listed above."
    },
    {
      "title": "Post-delivery chat",
      "text": "18 March, 16:10 — Elin: Thanks for opening the parcel with me. The two holders and trays look lovely, but the care card wasn't there.\n\n18 March, 16:18 — Zuri: Sorry about that. I left the card out when packing. I'll send you the cleaning instructions separately.\n\n18 March, 16:24 — Elin: Please do. Were the holders lacquered as agreed? I couldn't tell just by looking.\n\n18 March, 16:31 — Zuri: I believe they were, but I haven't checked the workshop record yet.\n\n18 March, 16:36 — Elin: All right. Please confirm after you've checked. I'll wait before using any cleaner.\n\n18 March, 16:40 — Zuri: Understood. I'll look for the record and get back to you."
    }
  ],
